{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>מלקוח</b> [spoil]: ב'. שא את ראש מלקוח [take up the head of the spoil] — היוקח מגבור מלקוח [that which is taken from the mighty is spoil]. Meaning: היוקח מגבור מלקוח [that which is taken from the mighty is spoil], and you take from the mighty spoil — therefore שא את ראש מלקוח [take up the head of the spoil], and give from it a levy to HaShem."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:32.921193302Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}